{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c1043cab2d4d9e709fdc2282815e74d04458a887b2439db030bc4dbe54b46c8e", "ja": "（『PRETTY DREAMER』の初披露公演が終わった。\nみんなの絆が感じられるステージだったな）", "zh": "（『PRETTY DREAMER』的首次亮相公演结束了。\n是场能感受到成员间情谊的表演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "43662ed1fff61e6258dcf160018b1d74469d7eddd8b65398e4bef0bdb585ece9", "ja": "{$P$}！\n今日の自分たちのライブ、どうだった？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我们今天的演唱会怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "51acafdda1d673e5fb5605fc2e8950709e2a83c92cbd31041a7a305b58edf12d", "ja": "お疲れさま、響。\nもちろん、すごくよかったぞ！", "zh": "辛苦你们了，响。\n当然非常棒啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "3e83b7fc59cb7d70fca0d41394efb4cc6ddf0c2675638a1187b879ac7152e869", "ja": "でしょ！　ふふん、自分たちなら当然さー♪\n練習してきたこと、全部出し切ったからねっ。", "zh": "对吧！哼哼，对我们来说是理所当然的啦──♪\n因为我们把练习成果全都拿出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d16aaaa53e176f333ef2c61a2040440ddb1290a43d4677721892327efe070b55", "ja": "でもその分、疲れただろ？\n早く休んで、じっくり疲れを取ってくれよ。", "zh": "不过也因此消耗了不少体力吧？\n回去要赶快休息，好好消除疲劳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "780618ddd98951e214817144c35a3fc1036feb78bd38b4edf9b28cfe596521b6", "ja": "自分なら、まだまだ元気いっぱいだぞっ。\n今からいぬ美と競走だってできるくらいさー！", "zh": "本人还很有精神喔！\n就算马上跟汪美赛跑也没问题啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "66a7e15281ed56ae07215f9b1ddcc37bc25fce9cf2de5be3daa1fc3a9213edd4", "ja": "そういう{$P$}こそ、大丈夫？\nまだこれから仕事でしょ？", "zh": "倒是{$P$}才比较令人担心吧？\n你接下来还有工作不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "102d0dd26da10ba404b6668deadafbb065940db72d57d70ffec9264b27945a80", "ja": "むしろ、これからが俺の仕事だ。今回、みんなの先頭に\n立ってくれた響に、負けてられないからな。", "zh": "应该说，接下来才轮到我工作。\n这次响站在前头领导大家，我可不能输给你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "1b8a0a927d009dea51feff26a684483c3ff56dd469345a6e3510bd319c148e3c", "ja": "えへへ、自分は先輩として、当然のことをしただけで…\nあ、そうだっ！　ちょっと待ってて。", "zh": "嘿嘿，本人只是做了前辈该做的事情而已……\n啊，对了！你等一下喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "af3772c9b37bcef6bc5b2c3fe1e9c98576168b3326ca1432bddb791bb92cfcec", "ja": "響？　待つって何を……おーい？", "zh": "响？你要做什么……喂～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "bf1842370063c43b666224999e034ca5f4f9c4f3238634fb0a5ca91c6e352b7e", "ja": "はいっ！　さんぴん茶、淹れてきたぞ～。\nこれ飲んで、頑張ってね！", "zh": "来！本人泡了香片茶喔～\n先喝了再努力工作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0a60f7a9e0c035079f40a2fbda7259a405887379c29a8c4ef06bc54c0d18f4b9", "ja": "えっ、今淹れてくれたのか？\nじゃあ、いただくとするか。ありがとうな。", "zh": "咦？你刚刚去泡的吗？\n谢谢你，那我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "b334319d116421bf459ee67b6062127088b8a99b2e17f6a271ae26efc4d023ad", "ja": "えへへ、なんくるないさー。\n自分、先輩だからねっ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，总会有办法的啦──\n因为本人是前辈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "8200d32e8317de28a1f7f3fd49a5a5022e306402db66c0858106127c416eb1f7", "ja": "ところで{$P$}、肩こってない？\n自分がもんであげる！　先輩だから！", "zh": "对了，{$P$}，你肩膀酸不酸？\n本人帮你按一按！因为本人是前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1014_p", "source_sha256": "39a0be673e60ab007ed1ab2c42fd77f64a35eea54c1935007185224f7193c061", "ja": "えっ？　いや、今は別に……。", "zh": "咦？不用了，现在不酸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "bd7e09e543538b881a024d12f1ea78e507f5eb8e4bd474c6fd6525b2f2856c10", "ja": "そうなの？　うーん……。あ、じゃあ、自分\n先輩だから、夜食のやきそばパン、買ってきてあげる！", "zh": "是吗？唔……啊，那这样好了，\n本人是前辈，去帮你买炒面面包当消夜吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ecd6fbba24c1bbad156ed67bc871c591ed5a0b230da3c8b8ed6cc5c50d5ebcff", "ja": "……それは先輩らしいのか？", "zh": "……前辈会做这种事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "719377a79db008ca403caf3953a80550b9a34332be4c0c112aff679becfb834a", "ja": "他にも何かあったら、自分に任せていいからねっ。\n自分、カンペキな先輩だから！　えへへっ！", "zh": "如果还有什么别的事，通通都能交给本人喔！\n因为本人是完美的前辈！嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "668a2e76cdde65a3c4d29be0fa1baf5333e8a36dfe2660fcc7ce20bb6b36bdf5", "ja": "（やる気がオーバーヒート気味だけど……\nこれも公演成功の証かな。響、本当にお疲れさま！）", "zh": "（感觉她的干劲有点高过头了……\n这也是公演成功的证明吧。响，真是辛苦你了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
